<title>USA: Penn Treaty American completes merger.</title>
<headline>Penn Treaty American completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penn Treaty American Corp said on Friday it completed the acquisition of Health Insurance of Vermont Inc.</p>
<p>Under the final terms of the acquisition, each Health Insurance Vermont share will be exchanged for about 0.86 shares of Penn Treaty common stock and $4 cash, Penn Treaty said.</p>
